  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Interamericano de Finanzas: Subordinated Bond to Boost the Green Portfolio in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Interamericano de Finanzas S.A. (&#x201c;BanBif&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Bank&#x201d;) and IDB Invest are currently evaluating a new transaction through a private local issuance of subordinated green bonds aimed at promoting the growth of the green portfolio. The total amount of the issuance will be in Dollars of the United States of America (&#x201c;US$&#x201d;) for up to US$40 million, comprised as follows: (i) a subscription by IDB Invest of up to US$20 million; and (ii) an amount mobilized from other co-investors of up to US$20million.Additionally, the project will be complemented by technical advisory services, defined jointly with BanBif, with the objective of strengthening its green sustainability strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
